===================================================
 Example URLs to Use:
http://localhost:8080/registrations
→ First page, 10 items, sorted by id ascending (default)

http://localhost:8080/registrations?page=1&size=5
→ Second page (page=1), 5 items per page, default sort

http://localhost:8080/registrations?sortBy=attendeeName&direction=desc
→ Sort by attendeeName descending

http://localhost:8080/registrations?page=2&size=3&sortBy=productId&direction=asc
→ Page 3 (index 2), 3 per page, sort by productId ascending

